{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/07/24/itm_3ced48895ed29264/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.21090","category_id":"llm-post-training","collected_at":"2026-07-24T04:30:19Z","content_hash":"b68dc548103451ab9f3ed8f286947c491da1a78031f3d19ce7cbbeabca751c91","external_id":"arXiv:2607.21090","fetched_at":"2026-07-24T04:30:19Z","fingerprint":"b68dc548103451ab9f3ed8f286947c491da1a78031f3d19ce7cbbeabca751c91","id":"itm_3ced48895ed29264","item_id":"itm_3ced48895ed29264","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","sort_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"这篇后训练论文把自解释忠实性写成反事实 RL 奖励：对 prompt 插入单一因素后，若答案翻转则记为影响，若解释提到该因素则记为披露，训练奖励两者一致。作者在 Llama-3.1-8B 与 Qwen3-8B 的随机词和 user-bias 干预上评估；最强同分布 Phi-CCT 为 0.664，Qwen 在 user-bias 的 OOD 集达 0.691，并未观察到真阳性解释的 prompt 复制显著上升。局限是影响标签由初始冻结模型预计算、训练后会陈旧，且只覆盖四个任务、两种 8B 模型、模板化提及检测，未报告任务性能或人类偏好。","tags":["post-training","reinforcement-learning","GRPO","faithfulness","counterfactual-evaluation","AI-safety"],"title":"Training Large Language Models for Self-Explanation Faithfulness","title_hash":"cf77c767b51051752675f2176a61d7fda41aaf7351d2aaa797e2b6276ff5b2f5","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.21090"}
